### without token
GET http://localhost:5080/currencies

### wallets of the logged-in user
# The token's name must be the user's numeric id, e.g.:
#   dotnet user-jwts create --name 10000001 --project src/FinancialApp.API
GET http://localhost:5080/wallets
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### wallets without token (401)
GET http://localhost:5080/wallets

### create a wallet
POST http://localhost:5080/wallets
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Euro card",
  "type": "bank card",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "startingBalance": 100
}

### create a wallet without a name (gets "Cash #1", "Cash #2", ...)
POST http://localhost:5080/wallets
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "cash",
  "currency": "RUB",
  "startingBalance": 5000
}
